<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Basis levels ease.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Basis levels ease.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basis levels for dark northern spring wheat eased by as much as 10 cents at some locations across the northern grain belt in response to the steady pace of sales this week, grain dealers said Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;It was busy this morning again. I think there's a lot of grain wanting to trade because (prices are) slipping,&quot; a central Montana dealer said.</p>
<p>But other dealers in Minneapolis said Thursday had been fairly quiet and not as busy as Wednesday.  </p>
